{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: Agent基础概念MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent 的四大核心组件是什么？各自承担什么职责？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent基础概念\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> fundamental\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/基础概念\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/fundamental</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 的标准架构由哪四大核心组件构成？每个组件的具体职责是什么？它们之间如何协作？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1. 答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 的标准架构遵循业界公认的核心公式：</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">Agent = LLM（大脑）+ Planning（规划）+ Memory（记忆）+ Tools（工具）\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>类比理解</strong>：可以把 Agent 系统类比成一家公司：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>LLM 是老板</strong>：所有决策都经过它拍板</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Tools 是外包执行团队</strong>：老板说\"去搜这个\"\"去发这封邮件\"，他们负责真正干活</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Memory 是公司档案室</strong>：各种信息的存档和调档</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Planning 是项目经理</strong>：拿到大目标后负责拆解成可执行的任务单</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>组件一：LLM（大脑/推理引擎）</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">职责：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">理解用户输入的意图和目标</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">进行逻辑推理和决策判断</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">生成自然语言回复和结构化输出</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">决定下一步该做什么（调用工具/继续思考/给出答案）</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Brain</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"Agent 的大脑 - LLM 核心\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> model<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>model <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> model\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">think</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> context<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> available_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Decision<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"核心决策：根据上下文决定下一步行动\"\"\"</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"\n        你是一个智能助手。当前任务上下文：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n        可用工具：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>t<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> t <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> available_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n        请决定下一步：调用工具 / 继续思考 / 给出最终答案\n        \"\"\"</span></span>\n        response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> call_llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> parse_decision<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>response<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 解析为结构化决策</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>组件二：Planning（规划模块）</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">职责：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">将复杂目标拆解为可执行的子任务</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">确定子任务的执行顺序和依赖关系</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">根据执行结果动态调整计划</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">评估任务完成度</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Planner</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"规划模块 - 任务分解与调度\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">create_plan</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> goal<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>SubTask<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"将目标拆解为子任务 DAG\"\"\"</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"将以下目标拆解为子任务列表：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>goal<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n        plan_text <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> call_llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> parse_subtasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>plan_text<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 解析为子任务列表</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">replan</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> current_plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>SubTask<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n               executed_steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>StepResult<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>SubTask<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"根据执行结果重新规划\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 动态调整计划，跳过已完成步骤，添加新发现的需求</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">pass</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>组件三：Memory（记忆模块）</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">职责：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>短期记忆</strong>：维护当前对话上下文，保持任务执行连贯性</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>长期记忆</strong>：持久化存储用户偏好、历史经验、领域知识</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>记忆检索</strong>：根据当前上下文检索相关历史信息</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>记忆更新</strong>：不断吸收新信息，淘汰过时内容</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MemorySystem</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"记忆系统 - 分层记忆管理\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>short_term <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ConversationBufferMemory<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>max_tokens<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">8000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>long_term <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> VectorStoreMemory<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>vector_db<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>Chroma<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">add</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> interaction<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Interaction<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 写入短期记忆</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>short_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>interaction<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 重要信息异步写入长期记忆</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> interaction<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>importance <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.7</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>long_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>store<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>interaction<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">retrieve</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> top_k<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>Memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 多路召回：短期 + 长期</span>\n        short_results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>short_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get_recent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>k<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        long_results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>long_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>similarity_search<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> k<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>top_k<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> merge_and_rerank<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>short_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> long_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>组件四：Tools（工具模块）</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">职责：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">提供 Agent 与外部世界交互的能力</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">封装搜索引擎、数据库、API、代码执行器等</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">通过 Function Calling 机制供 LLM 调用</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">管理工具注册、发现、调用和错误处理</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ToolRegistry</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"工具注册中心\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> BaseTool<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">register</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> BaseTool<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> tool\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">get_schemas</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"获取所有工具的 JSON Schema，供 LLM 选择\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>schema <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> tool <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>values<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">execute</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> params<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"执行指定工具\"\"\"</span>\n        tool <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"错误：工具 </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> 不存在\"</span></span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>run<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">**</span>params<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>四组件协作流程：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">用户输入 → LLM理解意图 → Planning拆解任务 → 循环执行：\n    ├─→ Memory检索相关上下文 → LLM决策 → Tools执行 → 观察结果\n    ├─→ Memory存储中间结果\n    └─→ Planning评估进度 / Replan\n→ 最终结果 → Memory归档\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">2. 延伸追问</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：四大组件中哪个最核心？可以省略吗？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：LLM 是核心，但缺一不可。没有 Planning 只能做简单单步任务；没有 Memory 会\"失忆\"；没有 Tools 只是\"纸上谈兵\"。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：Planning 可以由 LLM 直接完成吗？为什么还需要独立模块？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：LLM 可以做简单规划，但独立 Planning 模块可以实现更复杂的 DAG 调度、依赖管理、并行执行，比纯 LLM 更可控。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-heading=\"3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">3. 常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：四大组件是物理分离的四个服务</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：四大组件是逻辑划分，可以融合实现。如 Planning 和 LLM 可以合并，Memory 可以内嵌在 LLM 的上下文中</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"4. 相关\" dir=\"auto\">4. 相关</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a> — 返回主题导航</li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}